<title>JAPAN: Nippon Kakoh - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nippon Kakoh - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 29.24		vs	   28.97</p>
<p> Operating	  917    mln	  vs	    2.14</p>
<p> Current	    285    mln	  vs	    1.07</p>
<p> Net		  243    mln	  vs	  245    mln</p>
<p> EPS		    2.72 yen	  vs	    2.75 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     89 million	  vs	  89 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Nippon Kakoh Seishi Co Ltd is a paper manufacturer, strong in art and coated paper.</p>
